<h1>Mailman</h1>

<h2>game</h2>
<p>Deliver the mail around the neigbourhood, there is a total of 6 houses</p>

<h2>movement</h2>
<p>Use WASD for movement</p>
<p>Use F for interacting with things your character can stand on like the mailbox or random items</p>
<p>Use left mouse click for interacting with things like the start screen or things that may fall</p>


